@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam maxMessageSize 80
hide footbox
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant "c:RideListCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "m:ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

[-> Logic : execute(commandText)
activate Logic
note over Logic, Command : Parsing succeeds and produces c (calls omitted).
Logic -> Command : execute(m)
activate Command
Command -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Command : book
note right of Command : Find ride by ID and resolve all roster phones.\nFailure leaves the previous selection unchanged.
Command -> Model : updateFilteredPersonListForRide(targetId)
activate Model
Model -> Model : refreshRideListFilter()
note right of Model : Store activeRideListId; filter by roster phones.\nExisting sorted view supplies the cyclist panel.
Model --> Command
deactivate Model
Command --> Logic : result (members or empty roster)
deactivate Command
Logic -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Logic : book
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(book)
Storage --> Logic
[<-- Logic : result
deactivate Logic

legend bottom
  Initial roster selection only; cyclist and ride records are unchanged.
  Later roster changes refresh through the existing listener (next diagram).
endlegend
@enduml
